  "properties": {
    "title": "Implementation of MapLibre Viewer with React and GeoNode as Vector Tiles Server",
    "description": "The workshop addresses the process of adapting GeoNode 4.x as a Vector Tile server for the publication of geospatial layers with their information in a viewer developed in MapLibre within React.\n\nThe workshop will address the necessary steps to customize GeoNode as a Vector Tile server. We will work on the following points:\r\n\r\n* Review of data flow from production to publication.\r\n* Deployment of GeoNode in Docker Compose.\r\n* Adaptation of GeoNode as a Vector Tile server. \r\n* MapLibre style assembly base.\r\n* Deployment of Viewer in Docker Compose.\r\n* Configuration of layers to display\r\n\r\n##### Requirements for the Attendees\r\nMinimal Knowledge in the next fields:  \r\n* Web Development\r\n* Vector Tiles\r\n* Geoserver\r\n* Geonode\r\n* Docker\r\n* QGIS",
